// A few notes in a row -- still no loop, just several commands that
// each run once, in order.
//
// playt (opcode 0x23, "PlayTone"): frequency in Hz, duration in
// 1/100s. wait (opcode 0x43): source 2 = a constant value, value in
// units of 10ms -- "wait 2,20" pauses 200ms.
task 0
playt 440,50
wait 2,20
playt 880,50
wait 2,20
playt 1320,80
endt
